@baseUrl = http://localhost:5093

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Login with the development-only demo account
# The IDE HTTP client should retain the authentication cookie for the requests below.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@irisa.local",
  "password": "IrisaDemo!2026"
}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me

### List synthetic source records
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/demo/records

### Search a synthetic person
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/1111111111

### Invalid national code
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/123

### A valid-format code that does not exist in the source
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/people/9999999999

### Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
